crates/gpui/src/elements/div.rs hunk=22 added=110 removed=50 # Interactivity's listener lists become fast::interactivity::LazyVec and its rarely set parts fast::interactivity::Rare, a one-word change per field and a one-line change where each is set; Div's children are prepainted and painted through fast::layers::paint (scroll layers), calls rustfmt spreads over ten lines each; the rest are one-line state-version hooks and scroll layer hooks (the wheel listener noting its scroll, each ScrollHandle offset getter noting a read, bounds() translated, a children-prepainted listener noted)
