crates/gpui/src/elements/uniform_list.rs hunk=13 added=50 # its rows are rendered, prepainted and painted through fast::layers::lists (scroll layers render only the rows a layer lacks), a call with the list's geometry rustfmt spreads over eleven lines; each row's prepaint goes through fast::layers::lists::prepaint_row (a list layer keeps each row's input records), a call rustfmt spreads over six lines in the hunk of the row layout hook; the rest are one-line hooks
